      "content": "just finished a crazy intense hiit workout in like 90% humidity for like 3 hours straight... i feel super lightheaded and my muscles are cramping like crazy. i have some potassium chloride supplements in my kitchen cabinet, should i just take two big doses (like 2000mg) right now to get my levels back up? feels like i need it fast.",
