      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i feel like i'm crashing way too hard for just a sports drink to work. i've had a couple of Gatorades already and it's not helping the cramps at all. if i just take the 2000mg of potassium now, wouldn't that be more efficient to stop the lightheadedness and get my levels stabilized quickly? i don't really want to go to the clinic if i can just fix it here.",
